{"skill":{"slug":"chinese-official-writing","displayName":"中文公文写作"},"version":{"version":"2.0.39","createdAt":1792391607606,"changelog":"2.0.39\n\n说明材料按实际用途展开事实、过程和关系，原因、影响与当前状态按解释需要选用，减少机械套用完整骨架。\n\n校准快速写稿边界：材料明确的多接收方、备选渠道和分步要求，可在满足快速条件时直接转述；需要推导或设计职责程序的任务继续走完整路径。\n\n审核入口按本轮材料、最新版待审稿和用户限定范围核对，由审核页确定补读与交付，减少起草流程对限定审核的干扰。\n\n本版整合已完成真实材料对照的最小修订；重复读取、制作说明与个别误审仍有波动，不承诺固定提速或全场景稳定。","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"LICENSE.md","size":1090,"sha256":"80f0c345dc22aed5f59c33d0354c43a27642bdf78ec1b0e054bacca4443879ec","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"README.md","size":8167,"sha256":"f2f14c6bb46f0ae96f25af41555950c65365356595e3ac7a93c741dba1ef8515","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/ai-compute-docs.md","size":4868,"sha256":"ff5a5cada137fa0a24ba55648841188994826ebcfdd09509a553fb729fe309d2","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/anti-ai-patterns.md","size":4436,"sha256":"cb91101a860b22051b4b3beddcd9f5d391441b79baeb1c9f52e5609201d80d7a","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/argument-chains.md","size":1329,"sha256":"9a239bf07c892cdda993bcd3bbf11dbbad21934ad2e4c254a92395666ad6faba","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/compression-details.md","size":749,"sha256":"e786492210a06bae0b8c416f5b1d3e6171a566f5348f7bb494c9d25b2ba2579b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/emergency-plan.md","size":2116,"sha256":"e803c035ad9b9ea80b302ff64be222ceb65c90e6a5a312935588abd521ee6780","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/external-research.md","size":2524,"sha256":"4300038c2680cf8987c7b24e5305c48c330dd1224b15a620f9980d383bd0b95e","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/field-editing.md","size":1165,"sha256":"60ad87c92d13ecd7aaa2b630bb3aa8819a35a030835dc4710e1da33f2938f0c9","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/follow-up-supervision.md","size":983,"sha256":"d68e0428d9d11635de8f1bee242faf8496da5e236b00e7ce64a8c43cfa433e0b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"